      "statement": "step ca certificate unifies online and offline issuance through cautils.CertificateFlow; --offline and --token are incompatible because the token would be generated before the offline CA starts, and --attestation-uri and --kms are incompatible because the ACME-DA flow expects all parameters in the attestation URI.",
